            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değer koleksiyonunda hiçbir yinelenen öğe olmadığından emin olmak istediğimizde, onu burada görülen posta kodları gibi bir <strong>set</strong> içinde saklarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'SW1A', 'SY3', 'B44'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Küme, değerleri yinelemeden depolar. Değerlerini <code>{}</code> süslü parantezleriyle çevrele. Posta kodlarını bir kümede depola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;SW1A&quot;, &quot;SY3&quot;, &quot;B44&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
